{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019CVsvfsef9MT37szUfyemD","type":"tool_result","content":"=== intent.md ===\n---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: delivery-intent\nid: DI-RATE-LIMIT\ntitle: Enforce organization-level request limits with visible decisions\nclaim: proposed\nsource:\n  uri: tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\n  captured_at: '2026-08-02T00:00:00Z'\n  sha256: f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\nsuccess:\n- A versioned policy schema rejects invalid limits and windows.\n- Resolution produces exactly one effective policy for an organization.\n- Request 101 is denied after 100 allowed requests in the same window.\n- The denial returns a stable reason and emits matching decision telemetry.\nout_of_scope:\n- Replacing provider-owned usage metering.\n- Choosing production storage or deployment infrastructure.\n---\n# Enforce organization-level request limits with visible decisions\n\n## Delivery outcome\n\nFor every organization request, resolve one effective rate-limit policy, deny request 101 when the effective limit is 100, and expose a stable reason plus decision telemetry without changing provider-owned metering.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis artifact records a **proposed** claim. Its source, capture time,\nand content hash are recorded in frontmatter; the claim is not implementation\nevidence by itself.\n\n=== evidence.jsonl ===\n{\"claim\":\"external\",\"confidence\":1.0,\"id\":\"E-BLUEPRINT\",\"source\":{\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z\",\"sha256\":\"f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\",\"uri\":\"tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\"},\"summary\":\"Synthetic blueprint fixture describing the rate-limiting steel thread.\"}\n\n=== bundle.json ===\n{\n  \"contract\": \"TaskPlanBundle/v1\",\n  \"initiative\": \"rate-limit\",\n  \"lineage_digest\": \"69eb548452915a8e7066f4c273854eb39375238d7cc4e99371e096695c454bb2\",\n  \"plan_digest\": \"d6c110b43f89ca0bdec646405a7d247de5077aaa02c60c19105cb830bedd8352\",\n  \"signature\": \"hmac-taskplan-v1:d93ddcc9:d3e6d9072679bff3765270627ac9fbb3b97716fb7302049985ef6c76a8f195e6\",\n  \"snapshot_digest\": \"8827eb1d0e66051ef002954f0ac08af5ce775968c7122033488ad634a7f2fa62\",\n  \"units\": {\n    \"T-20260802-decision-visibility\": \"3c9e5d17921fcc1d4fe089b2619a6a7b76b1906fbea372a9633041fcbd4e84fa\",\n    \"T-20260802-effective-policy\": \"cfcef37b5819bd957fb918250a9c73bb0ce5f9900d0bac24090b951d024f8b91\",\n    \"T-20260802-policy-schema\": \"5e6880a656be7cea80e5b6e4d881764fa82dcd46e456e34ebdf9f015ca910eda\",\n    \"T-20260802-request-101\": \"f26e32c4369ac5aa22db0c5e9cb4b081f7605cc56fed3fd4fa18305db3287cd0\"\n  }\n}\n\n=== reviews ===\nreviews/delivery-plan-review.json\ndecisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62bc3ee2-1378-4030-af79-fa0e0ab9d373","uuid":"d07c4564-3478-4f45-8ca2-d7af925f146a","timestamp":"2026-09-14T22:24:49.402Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== intent.md ===\n---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: delivery-intent\nid: DI-RATE-LIMIT\ntitle: Enforce organization-level request limits with visible decisions\nclaim: proposed\nsource:\n  uri: tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\n  captured_at: '2026-08-02T00:00:00Z'\n  sha256: f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\nsuccess:\n- A versioned policy schema rejects invalid limits and windows.\n- Resolution produces exactly one effective policy for an organization.\n- Request 101 is denied after 100 allowed requests in the same window.\n- The denial returns a stable reason and emits matching decision telemetry.\nout_of_scope:\n- Replacing provider-owned usage metering.\n- Choosing production storage or deployment infrastructure.\n---\n# Enforce organization-level request limits with visible decisions\n\n## Delivery outcome\n\nFor every organization request, resolve one effective rate-limit policy, deny request 101 when the effective limit is 100, and expose a stable reason plus decision telemetry without changing provider-owned metering.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis artifact records a **proposed** claim. Its source, capture time,\nand content hash are recorded in frontmatter; the claim is not implementation\nevidence by itself.\n\n=== evidence.jsonl ===\n{\"claim\":\"external\",\"confidence\":1.0,\"id\":\"E-BLUEPRINT\",\"source\":{\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z\",\"sha256\":\"f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445\",\"uri\":\"tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md\"},\"summary\":\"Synthetic blueprint fixture describing the rate-limiting steel thread.\"}\n\n=== bundle.json ===\n{\n  \"contract\": \"TaskPlanBundle/v1\",\n  \"initiative\": \"rate-limit\",\n  \"lineage_digest\": \"69eb548452915a8e7066f4c273854eb39375238d7cc4e99371e096695c454bb2\",\n  \"plan_digest\": \"d6c110b43f89ca0bdec646405a7d247de5077aaa02c60c19105cb830bedd8352\",\n  \"signature\": \"hmac-taskplan-v1:d93ddcc9:d3e6d9072679bff3765270627ac9fbb3b97716fb7302049985ef6c76a8f195e6\",\n  \"snapshot_digest\": \"8827eb1d0e66051ef002954f0ac08af5ce775968c7122033488ad634a7f2fa62\",\n  \"units\": {\n    \"T-20260802-decision-visibility\": \"3c9e5d17921fcc1d4fe089b2619a6a7b76b1906fbea372a9633041fcbd4e84fa\",\n    \"T-20260802-effective-policy\": \"cfcef37b5819bd957fb918250a9c73bb0ce5f9900d0bac24090b951d024f8b91\",\n    \"T-20260802-policy-schema\": \"5e6880a656be7cea80e5b6e4d881764fa82dcd46e456e34ebdf9f015ca910eda\",\n    \"T-20260802-request-101\": \"f26e32c4369ac5aa22db0c5e9cb4b081f7605cc56fed3fd4fa18305db3287cd0\"\n  }\n}\n\n=== reviews ===\nreviews/delivery-plan-review.json\ndecisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
